            <div xml:id="d410">

                <pb facs="0679" n="577" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg577"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">550.S1/678: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in France</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Marriner</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-04-21T18:00:00-05:00">April 21, 1933—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>99. For Norman Davis. Your 177, April 21, 5 p.m. April 29th seems feasible and if
                    in the meanwhile the President and Mr. MacDonald, who will arrive here this
                    afternoon, have any suggestions to make you will be immediately advised.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
